# "Destroy up to one target": Bot1 cycles an Elite with X=1 choosing no target (Bot2's Sol Ring, mana value 1, stays), then cycles the
# second Elite with X=1 at its own Sol Ring: the artifact may be Bot1's own (CR 115.1), and it is destroyed. A Mox Jet (mana value 0)
# is refused as a target at X=1. Each Elite draws its card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Webstrike Elite
Webstrike Elite
Sol Ring
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Island x18

